export anchor CoolCorporateStyle:
    number: 190
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Cool corporate
    idea: A dependable enterprise console with a strong blue masthead, a light grey shell, crisp 2px corners and every section framed as a tabbed panel, so the dashboard reads like a well-ordered set of files.
    base: light
    palette:
        shell: #eef1f5, the page behind panels
        white: #ffffff, panels, the nav tab bar, table rows and fields
        ink: #1b2533, headings, table text and body
        slate: #4a5768, labels, column heads, meta and axis text
        rule: #cfd6e0, 1px panel borders and table rules, never text
        blue: #1748b8, the masthead, primary button, current tabs, links, this week's bars and focus
        navy: #0f3487, the search well inside the masthead and hover on blue
        ice: #e5ecfa, the current tab fill, last week's bars and hovered rows
        green: #17673a, On track with a solid circle and check
        amber: #874d00, At risk with a solid triangle and bar
        red: #b0231b, Behind, the overdue alert edge and the overdue KPI, with a solid square and cross
    type:
        One stack, Segoe UI, Selawik, Helvetica Neue, Arial, Liberation
        Sans, sans-serif, in weights 400 and 600. The page title is 24px
        semibold, KPI figures 28px semibold tabular, panel titles 15px
        semibold, tabs and body 14px, and column heads 12px semibold caps
        tracked 0.04em.
    layout:
        A full width blue masthead 56px tall holds a white outlined square
        mark with the brand, a wide navy search well, and at right a white
        New project button with blue text, a bell and a white initials disc
        with Mara Okafor. Under it a white bar of six icon tabs, Home with
        a 3px blue underline. The 1280px main area starts with a Home /
        Overview crumb, the greeting and the date at the far right, then a
        white alert bar with a 4px red left edge, a solid red square, the
        overdue line and a View overdue tasks link. A single bordered KPI
        band follows, split into four cells, each with an icon and label,
        the figure and a note, the overdue cell topped by a 3px red rule
        with red figure. Below, two columns at 8 to 4. The left Projects
        panel has a tab strip of team filters with counts, then a six
        column table of project, team, a bar with percent, tasks, due date
        with days left and status, and a footer line with totals and the
        next due project. The right column stacks a Tasks completed panel
        with Daily and Weekly tabs, grouped bars per weekday, last week as
        outlined ice and this week solid blue, and a small table of week
        totals and change, then an Activity panel with All, Comments and
        Files tabs and rows with initials, text and time at right. Below
        1100px the right column moves under the table. On phones the
        search drops to its own line, the nav tabs scroll sideways inside
        their bar, KPIs form a 2 by 2 grid and table rows become stacked
        cards.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px panel padding, 24px between panels, 10px by 16px table cells.
    density: Medium high. A real six column table with rows near 44px.
    corners: 2px on everything. Avatars are round.
    borders: 1px rule borders on every panel, table row and KPI cell. Current tabs carry a 3px blue underline.
    shadows: None. Panels sit flat on the grey shell.
    icons: 1.6px line icons at 18px beside nav tabs and KPI labels. Status uses solid shapes with a white glyph.
    focus: A 2px blue ring outside a 2px white gap, drawn with box shadow. Tabs show an inset 2px blue ring.
    tone: Neutral and precise. Short labels, caps column heads and counts inside tabs.
